# | Entes EPM-07S — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: Entes EPM-07S Modbus Register Map (Doc. A3919/Rev.2, 01.12.2019)
# | - 3-phase energy multimeter, DIN-rail, RS485 Modbus RTU.
# | - Holding registers (FC03/read, FC16/write).
# | - All instantaneous values are 16-bit integers (unsigned int or signed int), Big-Endian.
# | - Energy counters are 64-bit integers (long int = 4 registers), Big-Endian.
# | - Protocol address = ADDRESS_column − 1 = HEX_column value (0-based).
# | - Note: addresses 2, 4 are reserved/unused between L2 and L3 phase values.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Entes
@model=EPM-07S
@description=3-phase energy multimeter — per-phase V/I/P/Q/S/CoSφ, neutral current, totals, frequency, and 64-bit energy counters (16-bit integer registers, Big-Endian).
